flowchart TD
    A["Raw Sensor Channel i"] --> B{"Hard Range Check<br/>min <= val <= max ?"}
    B -->|No| F1["ISOLATE: Out-of-Bounds Sensor"]
    B -->|Yes| C{"Slew Rate Check<br/>|dx/dt| <= max_slew ?"}
    C -->|No| F2["ISOLATE: Physically Impossible Slew"]
    C -->|Yes| D{"Stuck Value Check<br/>var(x, 10s) > eps ?"}
    D -->|No| F3["ISOLATE: Frozen Transducer"]
    D -->|Yes| E{"Cross-Sensor Consistency<br/>e.g. CHT vs EGT Correlated ?"}
    E -->|No| F4["ISOLATE: Instrument Bias Failure"]
    E -->|Yes| Trusted["MARK SENSOR TRUSTED<br/>(Pass to Digital Twin & ML)"]
